  "notes": "Independent clean-state route through police -> hospital -> doctor branch.,Page 3 calls THE_HOSPITAL on non-autowired entry; persistent achievement read-back is not asserted.,The hospital scene automatically transitions to its vn_choices scene after the last page3 text portion. The choices checkpoint asserts both menu options before selection.,Selecting index 0 is observed by INSTEAD as act 01 and by NLBNavigator as clickchoice:0.,The pinned NLB page4 caption says it restores one HP and adds one wolfiness; expected state is wolfiness=1,hp=3.,The route ends at the automatic convergence on page5.\n\nДиагностический маршрут: 36 последовательных одиночных advances после выбора. Каждый checkpoint записывает состояние runtime; ожидаемые page/portion значения намеренно не заданы. Допускается пройти дальше page5."
}
